# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Adventure&Co — repository ignore rules
# The Unity project lives in "Adventure&Co/". Patterns use **/ so they keep
# working if the project folder is ever renamed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Unity generated folders (rebuilt from Assets/ + Packages/ on open) ------
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
**/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
**/[Rr]ecordings/
**/[Ll]ocal[Cc]ache/
**/[Uu]nity[Gg]enerated/
**/[Ee]xported[Oo]bj/

# Unity crash reports / misc generated files
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# Asset Store tools and Rider plugin (auto-installed per machine)
**/Assets/AssetStoreTools*
**/Assets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Addressables build output
**/Assets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*
**/Assets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
**/Assets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# Screenshots captured by the Unity MCP / editor tooling
**/Assets/Screenshots/
**/Assets/Screenshots.meta

# --- IDE / solution files (regenerated by Unity per machine) -----------------
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.tmp
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.consulo/
.gradle/

# --- Build artifacts ---------------------------------------------------------
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app
*.exe

# --- OS junk -----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Icon?
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
